    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ローリングアタック（2024/06/10）",
      "sourceHash": "f9a74ee8ba6c278b2c44d30624bc2bc40011e12466ac75a362354aabe9b69dea",
      "translation": "Rolling Attack (2024/06/10)",
      "contextHash": "f9a74ee8ba6c278b2c44d30624bc2bc40011e12466ac75a362354aabe9b69dea"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "範囲拡張プラグインとの連携で、直線上に攻撃します。動きが人間離れしているので、どちらかというと敵向けです。",
      "sourceHash": "f13ee247dce8ba329b02f30aef6e0743e647170346c5e9b5a3f1303498a3d10a",
      "translation": "It attacks along a straight line in conjunction with the range expansion plugin. Since its movement is far from human-like, it is more suited for enemies.",
      "contextHash": "f13ee247dce8ba329b02f30aef6e0743e647170346c5e9b5a3f1303498a3d10a"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-001",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<RangeEx:line> // 直線を対象に",
      "sourceHash": "168d5c8575358d90d1d6561d6175b440a751e5786eba4854132b0a9796f88013",
      "translation": "<RangeEx:line> // Target a straight line",
      "contextHash": "168d5c8575358d90d1d6561d6175b440a751e5786eba4854132b0a9796f88013"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-002",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Setting:NoStep> // 自動前進禁止",
      "sourceHash": "f3d03aa9df7580f3cf4d9d7b1fb1688306f2a6ac657f1073c860aca9d6fdbe9a",
      "translation": "<D-Setting:NoStep> // Disable automatic movement",
      "contextHash": "f3d03aa9df7580f3cf4d9d7b1fb1688306f2a6ac657f1073c860aca9d6fdbe9a"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-003",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "frame = 8 // 移動時間",
      "sourceHash": "d9564cf8bdd445b8498c7444dc62242e642b330c90babd50474030376be64fd6",
      "translation": "frame = 8 // Movement time",
      "contextHash": "d9564cf8bdd445b8498c7444dc62242e642b330c90babd50474030376be64fd6"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-004",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "rotation *= 4 // 回転数",
      "sourceHash": "ea6202606ff4ed4b5121dc3820c99159fdd667811d6e5488138e36fc82c4fb88",
      "translation": "rotation *= 4 // Number of rotations",
      "contextHash": "ea6202606ff4ed4b5121dc3820c99159fdd667811d6e5488138e36fc82c4fb88"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-005",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "// 対象毎のヒットアニメ",
      "sourceHash": "e90e3c04794c3a50ee7a1161d84756feede183f7520b2d8b35964bea6955df8c",
      "translation": "// Hit animation for each target",
      "contextHash": "e90e3c04794c3a50ee7a1161d84756feede183f7520b2d8b35964bea6955df8c"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-006",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "delay = 6 // ６フレーム待つ",
      "sourceHash": "bfdf698c038110c914f3ac8925f26c526c3e4188a135a2d6c384ecdaf5472760",
      "translation": "delay = 6 // Wait 6 frames",
      "contextHash": "bfdf698c038110c914f3ac8925f26c526c3e4188a135a2d6c384ecdaf5472760"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-007",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:return/> // 戻る",
      "sourceHash": "7f77ad63a3571415d6633e4cb0e448eb7b1086778df4ed4c31a04796120bd082",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:return/> // Return",
      "contextHash": "7f77ad63a3571415d6633e4cb0e448eb7b1086778df4ed4c31a04796120bd082"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "回転数は『rotation』で指定します。標準では前方に回転しますが、逆回転にしたい場合はマイナスをかけてください。",
      "sourceHash": "8256f08e40073da630cbbb126f9445cf659a0167a18159eaeb97893c4d483861",
      "translation": "Specify the number of rotations with 『rotation』. By default, it rotates forward, but multiply it by a negative value if you want it to rotate in the opposite direction.",
      "contextHash": "8256f08e40073da630cbbb126f9445cf659a0167a18159eaeb97893c4d483861"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "BattleManager._mainTargetがスキルの主対象を指します。targetにこれを指定することで、主対象を中心にして演出することができます。この記述がないとＩＤの小さい敵を基準に動作してしまうのであるほうがよさそうです。（2024/06/10）",
      "sourceHash": "a722a420a7308a30f1227fe028b93ccb8d85f2c5458a581e971dcdbff813bfc1",
      "translation": "BattleManager._mainTarget indicates the skill's primary target. By specifying this for target, you can center the effect on the primary target. Without this line, it will operate based on the enemy with the smallest ID, so it seems better to include it. (2024/06/10)",
      "contextHash": "a722a420a7308a30f1227fe028b93ccb8d85f2c5458a581e971dcdbff813bfc1"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-003",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "貫通ショット（2024/04/04）",
      "sourceHash": "acf6dfb6141d808e06f0ae531fa57aa2af419f99e1d8f7b80b1156ed219c2258",
      "translation": "Piercing Shot (2024/04/04)",
      "contextHash": "acf6dfb6141d808e06f0ae531fa57aa2af419f99e1d8f7b80b1156ed219c2258"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "敵を貫通する残像つきの衝撃波を放ちます。こちらもローリングアタックと同じ直線攻撃です。",
      "sourceHash": "944472b8c44f0df0d78f10043a98ee8914fe97ad57d2abe04e0cb4266038b657",
      "translation": "It fires a shockwave with an afterimage that pierces through enemies. This is also a straight-line attack, like Rolling Attack.",
      "contextHash": "944472b8c44f0df0d78f10043a98ee8914fe97ad57d2abe04e0cb4266038b657"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-008",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<RangeEx:line> // 直線を対象に",
      "sourceHash": "168d5c8575358d90d1d6561d6175b440a751e5786eba4854132b0a9796f88013",
      "translation": "<RangeEx:line> // Target a straight line",
      "contextHash": "168d5c8575358d90d1d6561d6175b440a751e5786eba4854132b0a9796f88013"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-009",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "// 発動ポーズ",
      "sourceHash": "bcfd9c278fad63a125e85359b521cd610ebf0877e86eafc582600493f8997ff5",
      "translation": "// Activation pose",
      "contextHash": "bcfd9c278fad63a125e85359b521cd610ebf0877e86eafc582600493f8997ff5"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-010",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "// 衝撃波",
      "sourceHash": "1f6e0c42d6b13dc3b73227a2a9652cf33095c0924e2759471252d5356dcd744a",
      "translation": "// Shockwave",
      "contextHash": "1f6e0c42d6b13dc3b73227a2a9652cf33095c0924e2759471252d5356dcd744a"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-011",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "id = XXX // 衝撃波のアニメーション",
      "sourceHash": "dac22c80266c1c6a7c97be6fd244192d743291a9c0d716532ed931fb0e7d2d8c",
      "translation": "id = XXX // Shockwave animation",
      "contextHash": "dac22c80266c1c6a7c97be6fd244192d743291a9c0d716532ed931fb0e7d2d8c"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-012",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "scaleY = 1 // 縦サイズ",
      "sourceHash": "cb438cf2913765b5474ffbc184f4dc547fc74610c79440b755974384e6928374",
      "translation": "scaleY = 1 // Vertical size",
      "contextHash": "cb438cf2913765b5474ffbc184f4dc547fc74610c79440b755974384e6928374"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-013",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "scaleX = 1 // 横サイズ",
      "sourceHash": "e9529fa7d68b81fa0cfb169b4ab2440730cbbeaad6a548b36c0a8b9e69e1d26a",
      "translation": "scaleX = 1 // Horizontal size",
      "contextHash": "e9529fa7d68b81fa0cfb169b4ab2440730cbbeaad6a548b36c0a8b9e69e1d26a"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-014",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "//rotation = 4 * (Math.PI * 2) * t/et // 回転させたい場合はどうぞ",
      "sourceHash": "6908d63109110452353949cafa2e6b1aebe4c5266d643b2474482304098a37c5",
      "translation": "//rotation = 4 * (Math.PI * 2) * t/et // Use this if you want to rotate",
      "contextHash": "6908d63109110452353949cafa2e6b1aebe4c5266d643b2474482304098a37c5"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-015",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "afterimage = 5 // 残像の数",
      "sourceHash": "4d9b9667ea8ebfabfbac0ba22e015e3e1db7d0c3868f865b947e8d74459ed564",
      "translation": "afterimage = 5 // Number of afterimages",
      "contextHash": "4d9b9667ea8ebfabfbac0ba22e015e3e1db7d0c3868f865b947e8d74459ed564"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-016",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "afterimageInterval = 1 // 残像の間隔",
      "sourceHash": "65641b1a51fdb586927f271ca2b8602f3955bb8740d850a875e6270e8b571865",
      "translation": "afterimageInterval = 1 // Afterimage spacing",
      "contextHash": "65641b1a51fdb586927f271ca2b8602f3955bb8740d850a875e6270e8b571865"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-017",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "// 対象毎のヒットアニメ",
      "sourceHash": "e90e3c04794c3a50ee7a1161d84756feede183f7520b2d8b35964bea6955df8c",
      "translation": "// Hit animation for each target",
      "contextHash": "e90e3c04794c3a50ee7a1161d84756feede183f7520b2d8b35964bea6955df8c"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-018",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "delay = 3 // 時間差",
      "sourceHash": "acac9cc525a5ec851583b1b353f5194590847129625cd98b5e0301b73a6d3e74",
      "translation": "delay = 3 // Time difference",
      "contextHash": "acac9cc525a5ec851583b1b353f5194590847129625cd98b5e0301b73a6d3e74"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-019",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "nextDelay = 2 // 対象毎の演出間隔",
      "sourceHash": "9480741cd88946a7aff321614707b612211b28cf61fd9e21d4cc6c1898c12acb",
      "translation": "nextDelay = 2 // Effect interval for each target",
      "contextHash": "9480741cd88946a7aff321614707b612211b28cf61fd9e21d4cc6c1898c12acb"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "衝撃波のアニメーションはWind2のパターンを使用しています。７フレームの固定画像をコピペしただけです。お好みで使用してください。",
      "sourceHash": "6273bbecc5ff17e04e3a297095d7a2007221ee1ff3aae8cb13bd66b8de1ca25d",
      "translation": "The shockwave animation uses the Wind2 pattern. It is simply a copied and pasted seven-frame static image. Use it as you like.",
      "contextHash": "6273bbecc5ff17e04e3a297095d7a2007221ee1ff3aae8cb13bd66b8de1ca25d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "lookCourseテンプレートによって、敵の方角を向きます。不要な場合は消してください。",
      "sourceHash": "e2022e0a8736350407e472e0d7f32c1ba781950365c2d2eddc73d58be64f7d00",
      "translation": "The lookCourse template makes it face the enemy. Remove it if it is unnecessary.",
      "contextHash": "e2022e0a8736350407e472e0d7f32c1ba781950365c2d2eddc73d58be64f7d00"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "rotation機能を使えば回転してそれっぽくなります。注釈（//）を外せば有効になりますのでこちらもお好みで。",
      "sourceHash": "b5ac26aabd6481347c6748abc156ce2850282afaab6d84bd372200dcff275e9c",
      "translation": "Using the rotation function makes it rotate and look more convincing. Remove the comment (//) to enable it, so use this as you like as well.",
      "contextHash": "b5ac26aabd6481347c6748abc156ce2850282afaab6d84bd372200dcff275e9c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "scaleX, scaleYを調整すればアニメーションのサイズを変更できます。例えば、scaleXだけを大きくすれば横に細長くできます。貫通系のエフェクトの場合、横長のほうが雰囲気が出るかもしれません。",
      "sourceHash": "7a8c2f399a65c8b8ce78e97704a4defcd41370269d794405ed563d6c61b3af57",
      "translation": "You can change the animation's size by adjusting scaleX and scaleY. For example, increasing only scaleX makes it longer and thinner horizontally. For piercing effects, a horizontally elongated shape may create a better atmosphere.",
      "contextHash": "7a8c2f399a65c8b8ce78e97704a4defcd41370269d794405ed563d6c61b3af57"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ヒットエフェクトにはＭＶの92番のアニメ（風/単体2）をそのまま使用しています。",
      "sourceHash": "ae9c668ac5ab8936251c167fbf8967ad50fb069c90d1999a1433bba6734edd98",
      "translation": "The hit effect uses MV animation No. 92 (Wind/Single 2) as-is.",
      "contextHash": "ae9c668ac5ab8936251c167fbf8967ad50fb069c90d1999a1433bba6734edd98"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-004",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "余波攻撃（2023/11/22）",
      "sourceHash": "05ac3d76ed80736b48665cf54cd3b575e9bd40ef9578e36e3825c8d7643d48f1",
      "translation": "Aftershock Attack (2023/11/22)",
      "contextHash": "05ac3d76ed80736b48665cf54cd3b575e9bd40ef9578e36e3825c8d7643d48f1"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "攻撃の余波でダメージを与えます。",
      "sourceHash": "19e3e48119db4548bfe16511a10707979ea81b3d736b8eab5b3dd30628e78664",
      "translation": "It deals damage through the aftershock of the attack.",
      "contextHash": "19e3e48119db4548bfe16511a10707979ea81b3d736b8eab5b3dd30628e78664"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-020",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "// 主対象へ接近",
      "sourceHash": "ee1b6d9ac342cad9c601464456451d257aa4019f6ed64101f617411de919fd4a",
      "translation": "// Approach the primary target",
      "contextHash": "ee1b6d9ac342cad9c601464456451d257aa4019f6ed64101f617411de919fd4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-021",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "// 主対象への打撃",
      "sourceHash": "c70526ce7e964c4e05486497f489f03e5cce8a9a1c52dbb3f3f4c2a471ceeda4",
      "translation": "// Strike the primary target",
      "contextHash": "c70526ce7e964c4e05486497f489f03e5cce8a9a1c52dbb3f3f4c2a471ceeda4"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-022",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "// 主対象を中心とした余波",
      "sourceHash": "9018f3ff4fcb0f8378f8890e6c516b37cb10824503b31c96da2c06e292d177e6",
      "translation": "// Aftershock centered on the primary target",
      "contextHash": "9018f3ff4fcb0f8378f8890e6c516b37cb10824503b31c96da2c06e292d177e6"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-023",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "sx = b.x // 本来の対象のＸ座標",
      "sourceHash": "afa44be63f075c660dac587eea099ea407e11c4f347c61002647925afcb1dda4",
      "translation": "sx = b.x // Original target's X coordinate",
      "contextHash": "afa44be63f075c660dac587eea099ea407e11c4f347c61002647925afcb1dda4"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-024",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "sy = b.y - b.height/2 // 本来の対象のＹ座標",
      "sourceHash": "ec1be6de23371a33e80861c19b742e0e09666847ee5cf52972811a17f3f10d09",
      "translation": "sy = b.y - b.height/2 // Original target's Y coordinate",
      "contextHash": "ec1be6de23371a33e80861c19b742e0e09666847ee5cf52972811a17f3f10d09"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "計算式を以下のように設定すれば、主対象（選んだ対象）とその他で与えるダメージが変化します。以下の式では余波ダメージを0.5倍にしています。",
      "sourceHash": "b2db24d9053c52215abdbc58972c337da18c2415fa1d27f5bf4fbae3d08ea669",
      "translation": "If you set the damage formula as shown below, the damage dealt to the primary target (the selected target) will differ from that dealt to the others. In the formula below, the aftershock damage is multiplied by 0.5.",
      "contextHash": "b2db24d9053c52215abdbc58972c337da18c2415fa1d27f5bf4fbae3d08ea669"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "<RangeExIf:true>によって対象を全体化します。",
      "sourceHash": "a0cdfc032862f74e9afa757bf125b59b4207a7b450adf90074b7237ab8182637",
      "translation": "<RangeExIf:true> makes the targets all enemies.",
      "contextHash": "a0cdfc032862f74e9afa757bf125b59b4207a7b450adf90074b7237ab8182637"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "これによって、選択対象は単体なのに範囲は全体となるスキルを作成できます。",
      "sourceHash": "696a2f1c1b46c024aa852c9931be7d6d27e0dc033826b3924536f4f7f56327cf",
      "translation": "This allows you to create a skill whose selected target is a single enemy but whose range covers all enemies.",
      "contextHash": "696a2f1c1b46c024aa852c9931be7d6d27e0dc033826b3924536f4f7f56327cf"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "BattleManager._mainTargetがスキルの主対象を指します。targetにこれを指定することで、主対象を中心にして演出することができます。",
      "sourceHash": "b9b24ad4608e2b9faa39a6016c074d777a9abc4e54f73c6d91caa44c0ebe51e2",
      "translation": "BattleManager._mainTarget indicates the skill's primary target. By specifying this for target, you can center the effect on the primary target.",
      "contextHash": "b9b24ad4608e2b9faa39a6016c074d777a9abc4e54f73c6d91caa44c0ebe51e2"
    }
  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "line-001",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "このページはDynamicAnimation（[[LINK_1]]ＭＺ[[/LINK_1]]、[[LINK_2]]ＭＶ[[/LINK_2]]）および、DynamicMotion（[[LINK_3]]ＭＺ[[/LINK_3]]、[[LINK_4]]ＭＶ[[/LINK_4]]）プラグインの解説の一部です。",
      "sourceHash": "b74f63ef2f94da136adbd71c6a193f68c88c5b44b87c8b7e804c790778a3b20f",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "このページはDynamicAnimation（",
          "link": false
        },
        {
          "source": "ＭＺ",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "source": "、",
          "link": false
        },
        {
          "source": "ＭＶ",
          "link": true,
